{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.evalPostprocessorTopLevel\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">evalPostprocessorTopLevel</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">post</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.Syntax.Term\">Term</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElabM\">Command.CommandElabM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\">PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Evaluates the postprocessor without leaking the traces produced by elaborating the postprocessor\nterm itself into the (typically trace-enabled) surrounding context.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.evalPostprocessorTopLevel","kind":"def","line":247,"name":"Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.evalPostprocessorTopLevel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L247-L256"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.runAndCollectMessages\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">runAndCollectMessages</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cmd</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElabM\">Command.CommandElabM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.Message\">Message</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Runs a command and returns all messages (sync and async) it produces, clearing the snapshot\ntasks after collection so that async messages are not reported twice. The surrounding message\nlog is unaffected; it is restored even if the command is interrupted.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.runAndCollectMessages","kind":"def","line":203,"name":"Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.runAndCollectMessages","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L203-L225"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.postprocessMessage\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">postprocessMessage</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">post</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\">PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">msg</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.Message\">Message</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.Message\">Message</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Applies `post` to a trace message (see `addTraceAsMessages`), returning `none` if the\npostprocessor dropped all roots of the message. Non-trace messages are returned unchanged.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.postprocessMessage","kind":"def","line":190,"name":"Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.postprocessMessage","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L190-L201"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.traceContainer?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">traceContainer?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">data</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a></span> → <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decomposes the synthetic container message produced by `addTraceAsMessages`\n(``.tagged `trace <| .trace _ _ roots``, possibly inside context wrappers) into its trace roots,\ntogether with a function that reassembles the container from transformed roots.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.traceContainer?","kind":"def","line":170,"name":"Lean.Elab.PostprocessTraces.traceContainer?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L170-L188"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.filterSubtrees\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">filterSubtrees</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Prunes the tree to the subtrees satisfying `p`, keeping their ancestors for context; `none` if\nthere is no match. The resulting tree consists of those nodes that either have a matching\nancestor or transitive child. Matching subtrees are not searched for nested matches.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.filterSubtrees","kind":"opaque","line":148,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.filterSubtrees","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L148-L160"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.collectSubtrees\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">collectSubtrees</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">acc</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.toArray\">#[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.toArray\">]</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Collects all maximal subtrees satisfying `p` in `acc`: adds `t` itself if `p t` holds, and\notherwise recurses into the children. Matching subtrees are not searched for nested matches.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.collectSubtrees","kind":"opaque","line":138,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.collectSubtrees","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L138-L146"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.result?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">result?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.TraceResult\">TraceResult</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `TraceResult` of a trace node; `none` for leaf messages and nodes without a result. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.result?","kind":"def","line":134,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.result?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L134-L136"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.headText\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">headText</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#BaseIO\">BaseIO</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The message of this node (without its children), formatted as a string.\nUseful for text-based filters but expensive.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.headText","kind":"def","line":122,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.headText","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L122-L132"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.selfElapsed\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">selfElapsed</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elapsed time of this node that is not accounted for by its children, in seconds; `0` if no\nprofiling data is available.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.selfElapsed","kind":"def","line":115,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.selfElapsed","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L115-L120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.elapsed\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">elapsed</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elapsed time of this node in seconds; `0` if no profiling data is available. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.elapsed","kind":"def","line":109,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.elapsed","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L109-L113"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.modifyData\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">modifyData</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.TraceData\">TraceData</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.TraceData\">TraceData</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Transforms the `TraceData` of a trace node. Leaf messages are returned unchanged. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.modifyData","kind":"def","line":103,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.modifyData","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L103-L107"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.withChildren\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">withChildren</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">children</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Replaces the children of a trace node. Leaf messages are returned unchanged. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.withChildren","kind":"def","line":97,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.withChildren","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L97-L101"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.children\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">children</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The children of this tree. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.children","kind":"def","line":92,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.children","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L92-L95"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.cls?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">cls?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The trace class of a trace node; `none` for leaf messages. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.cls?","kind":"def","line":88,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.cls?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L88-L90"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.data?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">data?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.TraceData\">TraceData</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `TraceData` of a trace node; `none` for leaf messages. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.data?","kind":"def","line":83,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.data?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L83-L86"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TracePattern</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A pattern selects the trace subtrees that an operation acts on (see `filter`, `hoist`, and\n`expand`). Patterns are ordinary predicates: the built-in ones (such as `containsString`,\n`unsuccessful`, or `minTimeMs`) can be combined with custom conditions in a `fun`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern","kind":"def","line":74,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L74-L79"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.instInhabitedTracePostprocessor\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedTracePostprocessor</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\">TracePostprocessor</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.instInhabitedTracePostprocessor","kind":"instance","line":72,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.instInhabitedTracePostprocessor","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L72-L72"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TracePostprocessor</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A trace postprocessor transforms the trace roots of a trace message before it is reported,\ne.g. by filtering out irrelevant subtrees or pre-expanding interesting nodes.\nReturning an empty array drops the trace message entirely.\n\nTraces are reported as one message per source range inside a command, and a postprocessor is\napplied to each of these messages separately; it therefore cannot move trace roots from one\nsource range to another.\n\nPostprocessors are applied by the `postprocess_traces post in cmd` command and can be composed\nleft-to-right with `>=>`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor","kind":"def","line":58,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L58-L70"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.toMessageData\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">toMessageData</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reassembles the `MessageData` of a trace tree. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.toMessageData","kind":"opaque","line":53,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.toMessageData","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L53-L56"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.ofMessageData\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">ofMessageData</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">msg</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decomposes trace `MessageData` into a `TraceTree`. The `MessageData` can be reconstructed using\n`TraceTree.toMessageData`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.ofMessageData","kind":"def","line":40,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.ofMessageData","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L40-L51"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.instInhabitedTraceTree\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedTraceTree</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.instInhabitedTraceTree","kind":"instance","line":38,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.instInhabitedTraceTree","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L38-L38"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.leaf\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">leaf</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">msg</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A child message that is not itself a trace node (e.g. produced by `addRawTrace`). ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.leaf","kind":"ctor","line":35,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.leaf","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L35-L36"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.node\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span>.<span class=\"name\">node</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">data</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.TraceData\">TraceData</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">msg</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">children</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">wrap</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\">TraceTree</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A trace node `[data.cls] msg` with the given children.\n\n`wrap` restores the context wrappers (`MessageData.withContext` etc.) that were peeled off the\noriginal `MessageData` while decomposing it; it is re-applied around the node by\n`toMessageData`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.node","kind":"ctor","line":26,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree.node","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L26-L34"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">inductive</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">TraceTree</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A structured view of a trace message (`MessageData.trace`), used by trace postprocessors\n(see `TracePostprocessor`).\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree","kind":"inductive","line":21,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.lean#L21-L36"}}],"imports":["Lean.CoreM","Lean.Elab.Command","Lean.Meta.Eval"],"instances":[{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.instInhabitedTraceTree","typeNames":["Lean.PostprocessTraces.TraceTree"]},{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.instInhabitedTracePostprocessor","typeNames":["Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor"]}],"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.Basic"}